# Modules on Sites, Chapter 1: Introduction

The source section introduces the scope of the book: sheaves of modules on
ringed sites and ringed topoi, together with the basic theory of abelian
sheaves and (pre)sheaves of modules.  It also points to the related chapter
on sheaves of modules and to the references FAC, EGA, and SGA4.

This section contains motivation, scope, and bibliography only.  It has no
standalone mathematical definition, assertion, displayed identity or
diagram, exact sequence, example, hypothesis, or mathematically meaningful
warning requiring a Lean declaration.
